<VI _name="Sensor Event Demo.vi" description="Demonstrates a user event that carries a double payload. A For Loop fires the Reading user event Count times with the payload values 0 to Count-1; a parallel While Loop handles each event in an Event Structure, reads the payload off its Event Data Node, counts the events and sums the payloads, and stops once Count events have arrived. The event is then unregistered and destroyed. One error chain runs from error in through Create, Register, every Generate, Unregister and Destroy to error out. With Count 0 or less no event is fired and the handler waits until Stop is pressed.">
